sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant C as Caller
    participant A as Async API
    participant P as Pool / pending queue
    participant D as Driver / virtqueue
    participant Q as QEMU device
    participant I as PLIC / IRQ
    Note over C,I: DESIGN ONLY - APIs and IRQ reclaim are not implemented
    C->>A: submit(A)
    A->>P: allocate, enqueue(A)
    P->>D: dispatch(A), map head
    D->>Q: publish + notify(A)
    A-->>C: return handle A
    C->>A: submit(B)
    A->>P: allocate, enqueue(B)
    P->>D: dispatch(B) if space
    D->>Q: publish + notify(B)
    A-->>C: return handle B
    C->>C: other work before wait
    Q->>I: used(head A), IRQ 1
    I->>D: ACK, map, free desc(A)
    D->>P: A=DONE/ERROR, wakeup
    P->>D: dispatch next QUEUED
    I->>I: plic_complete(irq)
    C->>A: wait(A)
    A-->>C: return saved result A
    Q->>I: complete(B), same handler
    C->>A: wait(B), release A,B
    A->>P: free slots, generation++
